@startuml drone-mavros-sequence
title drone-mavros: Startup & Telemetry Broadcast Sequence

participant "Docker Engine" as Docker
participant "entrypoint.sh" as EP
participant "ROS 2 Jazzy\n(/opt/ros/jazzy)" as ROS
participant "mavros_node\n(drone_mavros)" as MAVROS
participant "cc_telemetry_node" as CCTel
participant "mavros-telemetry-demo" as Demo
participant "mavlink-router\n(UDP 14541)" as Router
participant "FC (via Router)" as FC
participant "QGC / GCS" as QGC
participant "/run/drone/log.sock" as LogSock

== Container Startup ==
Docker -> EP : start (env: MAVROS_FCU_URL, ROS_DOMAIN_ID)
EP -> EP : Validate MAVROS_FCU_URL == udp://:14542@127.0.0.1:14541\n(reject other values with exit 20)
EP -> ROS : source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash
EP -> ROS : source /opt/cc_ws/setup.bash
EP -> EP : export LD_PRELOAD=libagridrone_plugins.so\n(intercept custom MAVLink v2 CRC)

EP -> Demo : /usr/local/bin/mavros-telemetry-demo &
Demo --> EP : telemetry_pid

EP -> MAVROS : ros2 run mavros mavros_node --ros-args\n-p fcu_url:=udp://:14542@127.0.0.1:14541\n-p tgt_system:=1 tgt_component:=1
MAVROS --> EP : mavros_pid

EP -> CCTel : cc_telemetry_node &\n(looks in /opt/cc_ws/lib/ first)
CCTel --> EP : cc_pid

EP -> EP : trap cleanup EXIT INT TERM\nwait -n mavros_pid cc_pid


== Steady State: FC Telemetry Flow ==
FC -> Router : MAVLink frames (UART ttyAMA4)
Router -> MAVROS : UDP :14541 -> :14542\n(agridrone plugin decodes custom msg IDs)
MAVROS -> ROS : Publish /mavros/state, /battery, /imu, etc.
MAVROS -> QGC : Custom MAVLink msgs (42012, 42013) via Router

== Steady State: cc_telemetry Broadcast ==
CCTel -> ROS : Subscribe ROS topics (/mavros/*)
CCTel -> QGC : MAVLink heartbeat + CC_CONFIG_STATUS (42012)\n+ CC_CONFIG_DATA (42013) via mavros router
CCTel -> LogSock : Write structured log JSON\n(/run/drone/log.sock)

== Steady State: GCS Command ==
QGC -> Router : MAVLink command (UDP :14550)
Router -> MAVROS : UDP :14542
MAVROS -> ROS : Publish /mavros/cmd/*
MAVROS -> FC : Forward arm/mode commands (UART)

== Config Change Notification ==
note over CCTel : When cc-config-agent applies a new\nnetwork/telemetry config, cc_telemetry_node\nbroadcasts updated CC_CONFIG_STATUS to QGC.

== Shutdown ==
Docker -> EP : SIGTERM / EXIT
EP -> MAVROS : kill -TERM mavros_pid
EP -> Demo : kill -TERM telemetry_pid
EP -> CCTel : kill -TERM cc_pid
EP -> EP : wait all pids; exit


note as DeploymentContract
  Source/config: GitHub pull
  Image: GHCR linux/arm64
  Pi update: compose pull + up --no-build
  Private runtime config/state stays outside Git
end note
note as MavrosMapping
  Compose: mavros
  Image: drone-mavros
  Context: src/mavros
end note

@enduml
